      "questionName": "vital, geology, giant, surface",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Reorder the letters to make complete words. The first letters are underlined.</strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Mark, have you ever thought about studying <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><input id='fbo-908539-0' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-908539-0' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908539-0' /></span> (O-Y-L-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">G</span>-O-G-E)</strong>? It helps us understand how things on Earth were formed.</p>\n<p>Mark: That sounds interesting! Why is it so important?</p>\n<p>Anna: Well, it&#8217;s <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><input id='fbo-908539-1' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-908539-1' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908539-1' /></span> (L-T-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">V</span>-A-I)</strong> because everything on Earth, even the smallest rocks, tells us about the planet&#8217;s history.</p>\n<p>Mark: Wow, I never thought about it that way. So, even tiny things on the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><input id='fbo-908539-2' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-908539-2' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908539-2' /></span> (F-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">S</span>-C-R-E-U-A)</strong> play a role?</p>\n<p>Anna: Yes! Over time, those small things have formed <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><input id='fbo-908539-3' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-908539-3' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908539-3' /></span> (T-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">G</span>-A-I-N)</strong> mountains, valleys, and oceans.</p>\n<p>Mark: That&#8217;s amazing! I didn&#8217;t realize how everything is connected.</p>",
