      "questionName": "climate change, effect, harm, adjust",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"316\"><strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"84\">Drag and drop to complete the passage.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"316\">One of the biggest challenges for our planet today is <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-908545-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-908545-0' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908545-0' /></span></strong>. It has serious <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-908545-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-908545-1' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908545-1' /></span></strong>&nbsp;on the environment. Rising temperatures, melting ice, and changing weather patterns are just a few examples of how our world is being affected.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"574\">Many animals and plants are struggling to survive because their homes are disappearing or changing. Some species are at risk of disappearing entirely. Humans are the ones who<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-908545-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-908545-2' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908545-2' /></span></strong> the environment by causing pollution, cutting down forests, and burning fossil fuels.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"955\" data-is-last-node>It is important for people to<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-908545-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-908545-3' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-908545-3' /></span></strong> their lifestyles to help protect the Earth. Simple actions, like using less plastic, planting trees, and saving energy, can make a big difference. Everyone needs to work together make Earth a better place for future generations.</p>",
