      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"40\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"40\">Read the following leaflet and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"40\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"40\">Protect Wildlife &#8211; Join Our Program!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"471\">Are you passionate about wildlife and nature? Our program is dedicated to protecting animals and their habitats. By learning how we can reduce pollution and use resources wisely, we can help create a safer environment for all living things.</p>\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"490\"><strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"490\">Did You Know?</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"909\">\n<li data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"586\">&#128062; Animals play a crucial role in the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-909245-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-909245-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909245-0'></option><option value=\"economy\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-0-economy'>economy</option><option value=\"solar system\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-0-solar system'>solar system</option><option value=\"global warming\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-0-global warming'>global warming</option><option value=\"food chain\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-0-food chain'>food chain</option></select></span></strong>, maintaining balance in ecosystems. Without them, the survival of many species would be at risk.</li>\n<li data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"703\">&#129422; <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-909245-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-909245-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909245-1'></option><option value=\"Reptiles\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-1-Reptiles'>Reptiles</option><option value=\"Insects\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-1-Insects'>Insects</option><option value=\"Mammals\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-1-Mammals'>Mammals</option><option value=\"Cattle\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-1-Cattle'>Cattle</option></select></span></strong>, such as snakes, lizards, and turtles, help control pest populations and support ecosystems.</li>\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"909\">&#127754; 8 million tons of plastic enter the ocean every year, which harms marine life and ecosystems.</li>\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"909\"><strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"599\">&#127793;</strong> 70% of species live in forests, yet forests are being lost at a rate of 10 million hectares per year.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What We Provide?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>&#127793; We teach how to use <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-909245-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-909245-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909245-2'></option><option value=\"fertilizer\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-2-fertilizer'>fertilizer</option><option value=\"power\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-2-power'>power</option><option value=\"energy\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-2-energy'>energy</option><option value=\"data\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-2-data'>data</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;wisely to maintain healthy soil and support plant growth, which animals depend on for food.</li>\n<li>&#127757; We give you some <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-909245-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-909245-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909245-3'></option><option value=\"difficult\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-3-difficult'>difficult</option><option value=\"demanding\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-3-demanding'>demanding</option><option value=\"inefficient\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-3-inefficient'>inefficient</option><option value=\"fascinating\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-3-fascinating'>fascinating</option></select></span></strong> and easy-to-do ways to recycle waste, helping create a cleaner environment where animals can thrive.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Join us to understand nature&#8217;s<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-909245-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-909245-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909245-4'></option><option value=\"protest\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-4-protest'>protest</option><option value=\"significance\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-4-significance'>significance</option><option value=\"belief\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-4-belief'>belief</option><option value=\"bullying\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909245-4-bullying'>bullying</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;and support our efforts to keep Earth a safe place for all living things. Together, we can make a difference!</p>",
